  "properties": {
    "title": "Generate, serve, and visualize your own base map or overlay tiles with MapLibre stack and Planetiler.",
    "description": "Create a tile server with the base map and some custom data.  Build a web site with both the base map and custom data, with some extra visualizations.\n\nSet up a Martin tile server to serve some custom datasets and a basemap, then build a website using MapLibre-GL-JS with some rich data visualizations.\r\n\r\nMake sure to install Docker engine to streamline development and deployment.",
